\[ r = (6357 + 3541) \times 10^3 \, \text{m} = 9898 \times 10^3 \, \text{m} \]

Substitute and calculate:  
\[ \text{GPE} = -\frac{(6.674 \times 10^{-11}) \cdot (5.972 \times 10^{24}) \cdot 300,000}{9898 \times 10^3} \]

\[ \text{GPE} \approx -1.206 \times 10^{11} \, \text{J} \]

